{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55500","headline":"钟山寺 · 乐史","name":"钟山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千峰夹一径，一径花枕泉。\n听泉复看花，行到钟山前。\n古寺云生屋，高僧月伴禅。\n自慙留一宿，匹马又朝天。\n（见厉鹗《宋诗纪事》卷三引《抚州府志》、影印文渊阁《四库全书》本《江西通志》卷一四八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乐史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}